# Development / scratch (do not ignore real project docs or CI)
# Agent system: .claude/skills + .claude/agents (Claude Code) and
# .cursor/skills + .cursor/agents + .cursor/rules (Cursor). Keep both tracked.
# Everything else under .claude/ is local session state.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
.codebuddy/
letsrebuild.md
# Root-only scratch markdown; keep README, CHANGELOG, agent entry, and all docs/
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/NAS-DEPLOY.md
!/VERSION
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md

